cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "biometryassist" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'biometryassist: Functions to Assist Design and Analysis of Agronomic Experiments'
version: 1.5.1
doi: 10.32614/CRAN.package.biometryassist
identifiers:
- type: doi
  value: 10.32614/CRAN.package.biometryassist
abstract: Provides functions to aid in the design and analysis of agronomic and agricultural
  experiments through easy access to documentation and helper functions, especially
  for users who are learning these concepts. While not required for most functionality,
  this package enhances the `asreml` package which provides a computationally efficient
  algorithm for fitting mixed models using Residual Maximum Likelihood. It is a commercial
  package that can be purchased as 'ASReml-R' from 'VSNi' <https://vsni.co.uk/>, who
  will supply a zip file for local installation/updating (see <https://asreml.kb.vsni.co.uk/>).
